*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0002
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-01-16 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   1998-12-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 715
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0002.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-INPUT.
    *> PRIOR BANKRUPTCY Y/N
    05 PRIOR-BK-FLG       PIC X.
       88 PRIOR-BANKRUPT VALUE 'Y'.
    05 BK-YEARS           PIC 9(2).
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 BUREAU-SCORE       PIC 9(3).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    *> A=APPROVE R=REFER D=DECLINE
    05 DECISION-CD        PIC X VALUE 'D'.
        88 DECISION-REFERRED VALUE 'R'.
    05 DECN-REASON        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-INPUT
    PERFORM PRIOR-BK-SCREEN
    DISPLAY "DECISION-CD=" DECISION-CD
    DISPLAY "DECN-REASON=" DECN-REASON
    STOP RUN.
PRIOR-BK-SCREEN.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 1996
    *>  IF BK-YEARS < 8
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF PRIOR-BANKRUPT
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> RECENT BANKRUPTCY DECLINE
            WHEN BK-YEARS LESS THAN 10
                MOVE 'D' TO DECISION-CD
                MOVE 'BK1' TO DECN-REASON
            WHEN OTHER
                SET DECISION-REFERRED TO TRUE
                MOVE 'BK2' TO DECN-REASON
        END-EVALUATE
    ELSE
        MOVE 'NA' TO DECN-REASON
    END-IF.
